            "review_text": "Charlette Bree\nWollongong, Australia234 contributions\n0\nAmazing Staff and Fresh Food\nOct 2016 • Family\nThis particular Subway was in the shopping complex just below our hotel so it was very convenient for us. \nThe produce was just as fresh as in Australia, menu was very similar, and the taste was what you would expect from subway. Price wise we were able to get a foot long subway melt and a chicken salad bowl for around $6 aud. \nThe staff were just incredible, so friendly!\nWe went to this subway 3 times and it was consistent every single time, even with different staff.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 25, 2016",
